## NAT Type Reference

| NAT Type | Connectivity Level |
|----------|--------------------|
| A | Best connectivity |
| B | Good connectivity |
| C | Moderate restrictions |
| D | Strict restrictions / multiplayer issues likely |
| F | Connection failure |

